 width=\"492\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Ironwood \n                                                    Crown</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/cra_cp_3.gif\" width=\"120\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\" width=\"368\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">엘프전용</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">자가복구(Self \n                                                    Repair) 3</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0px; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 10px; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">힘추가(Strength Bonus) \n5</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0px; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 10px; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">지능추가(Intelligence \nBonus) 5</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0px; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 10px; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">민첩추가(Dexterity Bonus) 5</span></font></p> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물리적저항(Physical \n                                                    Resist) 10%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">불저항(Fire \n                                                    Resist) 6%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">냉기저항(Cold \n                                                    Resist) 7%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">독저항(Poison \n                                                    Resist) 7%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">에너지저항(Energy \n                                                    Resist) 10%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">힘 \n                                                    요구치(Strength Requirement) \n                                                    25</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">내구력(Durability) \n                                                    43/43</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"492\">\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src