0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">야간투시(Night \n                                                    Sight)\n                                                    </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">공격속도증가(Swing Speed Increase)&nbsp;20% \n                                                    </span></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">피해증가(Damage Increase)&nbsp;60%</span></font> </p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">냉기피해 (Cold </span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Damage) 50%</span></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기피해(Weapon \n                                                    Damage)&nbsp;10-12 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기속도(Weapon \n                                                    Speed)&nbsp;2.25s</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">힘 \n                                                    요구치(Strength Requirement)&nbsp;15</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">한손무기(One- \n                                                    handed \n                                                    Weapon)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-